	file.0000000000000001.title: "&eStaTech Industry"
	quest.0A260F1B9E13182D.quest_desc: [
		"&eEMI&f, short for, well, nothing... is the included item search mod in the pack. Knowing how to use &eEMI&f will be key in the completion of the pack. For those experienced with &dJEI&r or &dREI&r you will find this &2very familiar&r."
		""
		"You can use the bar at the bottom of your inventory to &asearch&r &eEMI&f. Additionally, hovering over an item in your inventory and pressing '&6R&r' will display &2how to craft&f said item. You can alternatively press '&6U&r' to &3see all the uses&f of an item in your inventory."
		"When hovering items in the &eEMI&f pages to the right, you can use left-click to view recipes and right-click to view uses instead."
		""
		"Knowing how to do some more complex searches will also be helpful."
		"&b@modname&f - This will search &eEMI&r for all items provided by a specific mod"
		"&e#tagname&f - This will search &eEMI&r for all items in a specified tag, useful for searching things such as $ingots"
	]
	quest.0A260F1B9E13182D.title: "EMI Tips"
	quest.0B22FBBA7374A2E5.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have a &6Bronze Boiler&r built, you can use it to power other &7steam&r machines. The &6boiler&r will automatically produce and send &7steam&r to &aadjacent machines&r, up to 8 millibuckets per tick. "
		""
		"&6Bronze machines&r can only process recipes up to 2 EU/t. 1mB of &7steam&r is equivalent to 1 EU, meaning a &6boiler&r at &cmax temperature&r can power &e4 machines simultaneously&r."
		""
		"&7Steam Machines&r will &2accept inputs from any side&r, be it items, &7steam&r or another fluid. You can &6lock their slots by clicking on the lock in the interface&r. &2Locked slots only accept one type of item or fluid&r."
		""
		"Every machine has an &coutput side&r, and you can enable&e auto-output&r from the interface. Hoppers, pipes, and other automation can &2extract output items from any side&r, of course. You can also &breduce the maximum number of items in a slot by scrolling&r."
		""
		"Using a &ewrench&r, you can rotate any machine by right-clicking. You can &3rotate the output side&r by sneaking while you shift-click."
		""
		"&cNOTE&r: Breaking a machine with the &ewrench&r &cWILL NOT drop it&r. &aUse a pickaxe for that&r!"
	]
	quest.0B22FBBA7374A2E5.quest_subtitle: "Take notes!"
	quest.0B22FBBA7374A2E5.title: "Interacting with Machines"
	quest.0BD4ABE561F1F2F7.quest_desc: [
		"&aHammers&r from the &9Just Hammers&r mod aren't a great tool for properly forming &bplates and other factory materials&r, but they are a great tool for &csmashing things&r! "
		""
		"The &aIron Hammer&r from &9Just Hammers&r has the ability to aid you in the &cprimitive plates&r in the next quest."
	]
	quest.0BD4ABE561F1F2F7.title: "Smashing!"
	quest.0EF2CBA4F28AC98C.quest_desc: ["A &bGlider&r is an item that when active and being held by the player, will allow them to glide through the skies instead of falling normally. &eHold crouch to go faster&r."]
	quest.0EF2CBA4F28AC98C.quest_subtitle: "To the skies!"
	quest.171B6274F48C81EA.quest_desc: ["Did you &cforget to sleep&r for a bit and have to deal with the &amost annoying mob&r in the game? At least the &bPhantom Membranes&r allow you to upgrade your glider for enhanced speed!"]
	quest.171B6274F48C81EA.title: "add after packer"
	quest.1BD496A10E957F25.quest_subtitle: "A noble start to an epic journey"
	quest.1BD496A10E957F25.title: "Punch Trees"
	quest.1F8BAB70F2596659.quest_desc: ["With your Forge Hammer finally available, you can properly protect yourself from the creatures of the night "]
	quest.1F8BAB70F2596659.title: "Armor Up"
	quest.250141B40163F07F.quest_desc: ["Do you have a lot of a single item clogging up your chests? Why not invest in some Storage Drawers. These allow you to store items in bulk and have easy access to them!"]
	quest.3367CF1056CBCB36.quest_desc: [
		"&aMain Progress&r of the pack is provided in each chapter under the &l&e-- &6Chapters &e--&r section. The entries below the &l&e-- &6Side Chapters &e--&r section are not required to progress, but may provide very useful items and tools to aid you in your journey."
		""
		"Quests with a &asquare border&r are &drequired for progression&r, while &brounded edges&r indicate an &2optional quest&r."
	]
	quest.3367CF1056CBCB36.title: "Chapter Progression"
	quest.339F676C828C790D.quest_desc: ["You'll need to make some basic tools to get started. Stone seems to be good enough for the material."]
	quest.339F676C828C790D.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to the Stone Age"
	quest.339F676C828C790D.title: "Cave Man"
	quest.372FE691538408B9.quest_desc: ["This pack includes &aSpice of Life: Carrot Edition&r. This mod rewards you for &btrying different foods&r by increasing the number of &chearts&r you have with more food eaten!"]
	quest.372FE691538408B9.title: "Spice of Life"
	quest.3938FA0F25E9B17C.quest_desc: [
		"This pack includes &eJourneyMap&r. This mod allows for &dbookmarking&r locations and viewing the world around you!"
		""
		"Press '&eB&r' to create a new waypoint"
		"Press '&eN&r' to display all your waypoints"
		"Press '&eJ&r' to open the fullscreen map"
	]
	quest.3938FA0F25E9B17C.title: "JourneyMap"
	quest.40F3373B8AFDE427.quest_desc: [
		"&aFire Clay Dust&r can be made by mixing two &7Clay Balls&r and two &cBrick Dusts&r. This dust is used to create &bFire Clay Bricks&r, a sturdy foundation for your starter machinery."
		""
		"You &close a lot&r of product mixing these dusts by hand, you'll want to prioritize getting a &abetter way&r to mix them.  "
	]
	quest.40F3373B8AFDE427.title: "Fire Clay Dust"
	quest.412958496FE9150E.quest_desc: [
		"The Forge Hammer is the key component to crafting all of your early game components for machines and other utilities."
		""
		"The Forge Hammer also has the added benefit of doubling your ore outputs! Utilizing this feature will be key to help with the cost of the upcoming recipes! "
	]
	quest.445CFAFF2EC221A7.title: "Compacting Drawers"
	quest.4518B0E50C0271EE.quest_desc: ["The &aNature's Compass&r is a very helpful tool if you're looking for &6any specific biome&r. It provides both the &ddirection&r and the &2distance&r to any biome in the pack."]
	quest.4679B4825F85EBB5.quest_desc: ["You're going to struggle to properly form metals into the shapes you need to begin your factory. You'll need a &aproper workstation&r to achieve this goal. Using a &ehammer&r on an &biron block&r will form a &aLarge Iron Plate&r, which is flat enough to be the top of your &6Forge Hammer&r. "]
	quest.4857CFD9BEC908EA.quest_desc: [
		"Throughout your progression in this &3questbook&r you will earn &eStaTech Coins&r. These can be used to &acraft certain materials&r you may be needing in your adventure. "
		""
		"The coins are &2only rewarded for mainline quest progression&r for balance, and you will &dgradually earn more valuable coins&r as you progress!"
		""
		"Check &dEMI&r for a list of what you can make with the &eCoins&r!"
	]
	quest.4857CFD9BEC908EA.quest_subtitle: "I've seen this before!"
	quest.4857CFD9BEC908EA.title: "StaTech Coins"
	quest.587FF748139BA962.quest_desc: [
		"The steam machines you will soon be crafting will require steam to function. To create steam, you will need to create the &6Bronze Boiler&r."
		""
		"The &6Bronze Boiler&r will slowly use fuel to heat itself up. When it's hot enough, and has water in it, &eit will start to produce steam&r."
		""
		"The &6Bronze Boiler&r &bwill not continue to consume your fuel&r once its internal steam buffer is full. You can input &3water&r into the boiler by hand with a bucket, or by using &aFluid Pipes&r."
		""
		"&cAdding water to an already heated boiler will NOT make it detonate.&r"
	]
	quest.587FF748139BA962.quest_subtitle: "Steampunk!"
	quest.58F52B959643FF34.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &aStaTech Industry&r &d2.0&r!"
		""
		"This &aquest book&r will be your guide through the entirety of the modpack. &6Progression&r is broken down into &2chapters&r. You must complete all the &drequired quests&r in one chapter to advance to the next."
		""
		"Don't worry about losing the &bQuest Book&r, as you can access the quests by clicking the &bQuest Book&r in the top left of your inventory or pressing &eF4&r. Completing quests will reward you with &bXP and items&r, so it's worth following through your journey."
		""
		"The main focus of this pack is the mod &aModern Industrialization&r, a &2GregTech&f-like mod that will have you building complex item processing lines and lots of automation."
		""
		"Don't be afraid by the mention of &2GregTech&r, as &aMI&r has a lot of changes to make playing through it much easier, such as:"
		""
		"- Removal of &6individual tiered machines&r, you can choose to &aoverclock&r machine speeds as your progress."
		""
		"- Removal of the &chalf-dozen tedious tools&r in early &aearly game crafting&r"
		""
		"- A powerful &bpipe-system&r that you get access to very early"
		""
		"- Ways of &3generating resources&r without having to leave your base"
	]
	quest.58F52B959643FF34.quest_subtitle: "Start of A Journey"
	quest.58F52B959643FF34.title: "Welcome!"
	quest.649575B205DA42DF.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMeasuring Tape&r serves one purpose, to measure distance!"
		""
		"&6Right-click&r to mark position one, and again to mark position two."
		""
		"&6Shift right-click&r to clear the measurement."
	]
	quest.6C0000F5F41F4D69.quest_subtitle: "Going up?"
	quest.6C0000F5F41F4D69.title: "Elevators"
	quest.7464978AD0091E70.quest_desc: [
		"If you're able to find some early slime, the &aSlime Sling&r and &bSlime Boots&r combo cannot be beaten for early game traversal."
		""
		"I've taken the liberty of making both of these item's &dUnbreakable&r when you craft them. You're welcome :)"
	]
	quest.7464978AD0091E70.title: "Bouncing Around"
	quest.74B14DB45316C4F8.quest_desc: [
		"Your &afirst goal&r for progression with your new &bForge Hammer&r is to crush down &cCopper&r and &7Tin&r into dusts."
		""
		"With these dusts, you can combine them to create &6Bronze Dust&r, which can be smelted for its respective ingot form. "
		""
		"You &close a lot&r of product mixing these dusts by hand, you'll want to prioritize getting a &abetter way&r to mix them. "
	]
	quest.74B14DB45316C4F8.title: "Bronze Preparation"
	quest.74C1F78B349FC947.quest_desc: [
		"To get started in your industrial journey, you'll need a &aForge Hammer&r and a &eHammer&r from &6Modern Industrialization&r. &eHammers&r from any other mod will &cNOT WORK&r in the &aForge Hammer&r!"
		""
		"The &aForge Hammer&r is used to craft essential materials, it also allows you to &3duplicate your ores&r! Check &dEMI&r for everything you can do with it. &cNote that some ores do not work in it&r, and will require a &2Macerator&r to properly crush!"
		""
		"With these crafted, you have &acompleted the first chapter&r! In the next chapter, you will be moving towards making your own &6Bronze Machines&r!"
	]
	quest.74C1F78B349FC947.quest_subtitle: "Birthplace of Industry"
	quest.74C1F78B349FC947.title: "Tools of the Trade"
